WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.851
To put the numbers in one place: on CIFAR-10,

00:00:02.931 --> 00:00:09.821
the homeostatic loss lifts asymmetric EP from sixty
point four to eighty-four point three percent accuracy,

00:00:09.901 --> 00:00:14.577
closing the gap to the symmetric network to just
four point three points.

00:00:14.657 --> 00:00:16.987
On ImageNet thirty-two by thirty-two,

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:22.589
EP reaches thirty-one point four percent Top-1 and
fifty-five point two percent Top-5,

00:00:22.669 --> 00:00:24.478
the first result of its kind.

00:00:24.558 --> 00:00:27.214
And on Fashion MNIST, using a large nudge,

00:00:27.294 --> 00:00:34.770
the exact holomorphic estimate cuts error from
thirty-eight point four percent down to fourteen point three percent.
